OL,3,GNEWSAWork begins to restore canal
OL,4,Afilled in for M5
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has begun to restore a missing
OL,7,Fsection of canal that was filled in to
OL,8,Fmake way for the construction of the M5
OL,9,Fin the 1960s.
OL,11,FAfter years of planning, volunteers
OL,12,Ffrom the Cotswold Canal Trust have
OL,13,Fstarted work on the Missing Mile
OL,14,Fproject.
OL,16,FThe work will see the Stroudwater
OL,17,FNavigation waterway restored -
OL,18,Falongside locks, bridges and wetlands -
OL,19,Fto create a navigable route from the
OL,20,FRiver Severn to River Thames.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
