OL,3,GNEWSAWork begins to restore canal
OL,4,Afilled in for M5
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We can't restore the canal along its
OL,7,Fold route, so we now have to work to a
OL,8,Fdifferent alignment," said the trust's
OL,9,Fchairman of trustees David Hagg. "At
OL,10,Fthe moment, we've got lots of
OL,11,Fvolunteers digging a new canal
OL,12,Fchannel."
